    "Stem": "Mariela Hoffmann, controller at Flash Manufacturing, is preparing for the Certified Internal Auditor (CIA) examination. With the exam two weeks away, the month-end close deadline and her supervisor's schedule demands leave her no time to study. Which requirement of the IMA Statement of Ethical Professional Practice Competence standard is most directly at issue in her situation?",
