    "UniqueConceptKey": "F-249-md-and-a-forward-looking",
    "Stem": "Priya Ramaswamy, senior investor-relations analyst at Flash Industrial, is drafting the Management Discussion and Analysis (MD&A) section of the quarterly report. The company's outlook is favorable, but the forecast rests on assumptions that could fail to hold. Under the IMA Statement of Ethical Professional Practice Credibility standard, how should Priya present the forward-looking information?",
