      "application_to_facts": "The hub's single-clerk cash handling is a control gap that creates the opportunity element of the fraud triangle; quantifying the exposure as $250,000 × 3% × 52 = $390,000 supports Maya's fraud risk assessment.",
      "key_conclusion": "The estimated annual fraud exposure from the control gap is $390,000."
