    "UniqueConceptKey": "insider-trading-blackout-period-restriction",
    "Stem": "Maya Caldwell, treasurer and risk officer of Flash Capital, is an executive officer of the company. Flash Capital's retirement plan administrator has announced a blackout period of several days during which plan participants cannot trade or reallocate their plan accounts, and Maya holds Flash Capital shares in her personal brokerage account. She wants to sell a block of those shares during the blackout window to finance a home purchase. Under SOX §306, what should Maya do?",
