    "ExplanationWrongC": "Filing a Form 4 within two business days reports a completed transaction to the SEC, but timely disclosure does not authorize an unlawful trade; the §306 prohibition makes the sale itself a violation during the blackout period, so after-the-fact reporting cannot cure it.",
