    "ExplanationWrongB": "",
    "ExplanationWrongC": "Recusing from the next competitive review does not undo the appearance that the gift followed the renewal award, and the IMA Objectivity standard requires avoiding or disclosing the conflict rather than managing future decisions around it.",
    "ExplanationWrongD": "Donating the value of the basket does not remove the appearance that the gift was tied to the award decision already made, so the conflict remains; the required response under the Objectivity standard is to decline or disclose, not to neutralize the benefit afterward.",
