      "application_to_facts": "The dinner and gift basket arrived immediately after Priya's recommendation won the supplier a five-year renewal, so the benefit is tied to a decision she made; under the Objectivity standard the conflict must be avoided or disclosed rather than measured against the $500 policy cap.",
