    "UniqueConceptKey": "reserve-release-earnings-target-integrity",
    "Stem": "Adaeze Onuorah, the CFO of Flash Holdings, is told by the chief executive that the industrial segment must hit its earnings target or bonuses will be cut. The controller proposes releasing $2.4 million of the $3.0 million contingency reserve to close the gap, even though the underlying contingencies remain unresolved. Under the IMA Statement of Ethical Professional Practice, what should Adaeze do?",
