    "UniqueConceptKey": "credibility-disclosure-material-contingency",
    "Stem": "Mariela Hoffmann, controller of Flash Manufacturing, is finalizing the quarterly financial statements. Flash Manufacturing is a defendant in a product-liability lawsuit seeking damages that would be material to its results, and legal counsel assesses the loss as probable and reasonably estimable. Adaeze Onuorah, the CFO, has instructed Mariela to omit the contingency from the statements because it is 'too uncertain to be reliable.' What should Mariela do to comply with the IMA Statement of Ethical Professional Practice?",
