      "A": "Omit the contingency as instructed, because final disclosure authority rests with the CFO and the amount is only an estimate.",
      "B": "Disclose the contingency, because the Credibility standard requires communicating all relevant information that could reasonably be expected to influence an intended user's understanding of the reports.",
