      "rule_or_proposition": "Credibility requires communicating information fairly and objectively and disclosing all relevant information that could influence an intended user's understanding.",
      "application_to_facts": "The 2.4% claims database and 2.1% third-party study are relevant evidence that conflicts with the 1.2% assumption, so the analyst must surface and quantify the discrepancy rather than accept or reflexively override the estimate.",
      "key_conclusion": "Lena should challenge the estimate using the observed claims evidence and discuss it with management."
