    "uniqueness_note": "Choice A is wrong because management's knowledge does not override contradicting objective evidence. Choice B is wrong because auditor reliance replaces rather than exercises the analyst's skepticism. Choice D is wrong because reflexively conservative estimates are not evidence-based skepticism. Choice C is the only response that challenges the estimate using the observed data and discusses it with management.",
