    "ExplanationCorrect": "The IMA Objectivity Standard requires disclosing fully all relevant information that could reasonably be expected to influence an intended user's understanding and communicating information fairly and objectively, so the reported transfer price must reflect the actual arm's-length terms of the transaction.",
    "ExplanationWrongA": "",
