    "ExplanationWrongC": "Disclosing the change only to the CFO in a private memo does not satisfy objectivity, which requires that the information be reflected in the report or disclosed to the intended users of the segment information so that their understanding is not distorted.",
    "ExplanationWrongD": "The IMA ethical conflict resolution process directs the member to follow the organization's internal procedures and discuss the matter with supervisors before external escalation, so immediately reporting to the external auditors without those steps is not the required first response to the instruction.",
