    "UniqueConceptKey": "employee-salary-data-confidentiality",
    "Stem": "Mariela Hoffmann, controller of Flash Industrial, receives a request from the human resources director for the full payroll file, including individual employee salaries, to support a compensation benchmarking study. Payroll records have previously been accessible only to the payroll team, and no document authorizes the HR director's access. Under the IMA Confidentiality Standard, what is the most appropriate response?",
