    "UniqueConceptKey": "credibility-quantitative-qualitative-disclosure",
    "Stem": "Priya Ramaswamy, investor relations analyst at Flash Foods, a public issuer, is drafting the annual sustainability report, which follows GRI-style disclosures and will accompany the earnings release. The draft describes 'substantially reduced packaging waste' based on a 4% year-over-year decline concentrated in a single quarter, and it presents the non-GAAP measure 'adjusted packaging waste per unit' without a reconciliation. Under the IMA Credibility Standard and SEC Regulation G, what should Priya recommend?",
