    "Stem": "Lena Fischer, a credit analyst at Flash Capital, finds that the company's automated loan-scoring model rejects applicants in a protected demographic at a materially higher rate even after controlling for credit risk. She raises the finding with Maya Caldwell, the risk officer. Which statement best explains the ethical obligation the finance team faces on the finding?",
