    "UniqueConceptKey": "channel-stuffing-sales-incentive-structure",
    "Stem": "Mariela Hoffmann, controller of Flash Manufacturing, reviews the quarterly sales incentive plan: the sales force earns bonuses based on units shipped to distributors, and distributors may return unsold goods for a full refund. Shipments to distributors have surged far beyond historical sell-through rates. Under the IMA Statement of Ethical Professional Practice, which statement best describes the risk created by this structure?",
