      "application_to_facts": "The call ends Friday 3:00 p.m.; the 24-hour prong expires Saturday 3:00 p.m., while the next trading day opens Monday 9:30 a.m., so the deadline is Monday's open, which is 9 + 24 + 24 + 9.5 = 66.5 hours after the call.",
