    "UniqueConceptKey": "professional-skepticism-revenue-cutoff-testing",
    "Stem": "Lena Fischer, a financial analyst at Flash Foods, is performing year-end revenue cutoff testing. She finds several sales invoices dated December 31 whose shipping documents show the goods were not dispatched until January 2 of the new year. Management explains that the December 31 invoice dates reflect when the orders were accepted. Under the IMA Statement of Ethical Professional Practice, which action best reflects professional skepticism?",
