    "UniqueConceptKey": "tone-at-the-top-compensation-incentive-design",
    "Stem": "Flash Foods's board asks Adaeze Onuorah, the CFO, to recommend changes to the executive incentive plan, which currently pays a large bonus for quarterly sales volume and has been criticized for encouraging aggressive revenue recognition near year-end. The board wants the plan to reinforce an ethical tone at the top. Which incentive redesign best accomplishes that goal?",
