    "UniqueConceptKey": "integrity-inventory-valuation-consistency",
    "Stem": "Mariela Hoffmann, controller at Flash Foods, is asked by the general manager to change the inventory costing method to whichever method produces the highest income this quarter. The current method better reflects the company's actual flow of goods, and the requested switch is motivated by the earnings target rather than by the method's suitability. Under the IMA Statement of Ethical Professional Practice, what should Mariela do?",
