    "Stem": "Lena Fischer, financial analyst at Flash Capital, is reviewing a proposed joint venture with a foreign partner whose principal shareholder is a senior government official and whose marketing arm reportedly pays local customs officers for expedited clearance. Management asks for her recommendation before committing funds. Which course of action best aligns with the FCPA?",
