      "B": "Omit any assurance language because sustainability metrics are outside the scope of financial statement audits and are inherently estimates.",
      "C": "Describe the engagement accurately as providing limited assurance and disclose the scope, level, and limitations of the procedures performed.",
      "D": "Rely on the internal review by the controller, Mariela Hoffmann, as sufficient support for presenting the metric as independently assured."
