      "application_to_facts": "Mariela holds confidential information about Flash Industrial's proprietary algorithm and learns of misuse by a former engineer; a board member asks her to conceal it, but the standard obliges her to inform the appropriate internal parties and take reasonable steps to contain further dissemination.",
      "key_conclusion": "Mariela satisfies the confidentiality standard by informing the appropriate internal parties of the misuse and taking reasonable steps to limit further dissemination of the code."
