      "rule_or_proposition": "The objectivity standard requires members to communicate information fairly and objectively and to refrain from allowing bias, conflict of interest, or the undue influence of others to override professional judgments.",
      "application_to_facts": "Extending a lead engagement partner past the 5-year rotation cap so the same partner can finish a systems migration creates 4 + 3 = 7 total consecutive years, an excess of 7 - 5 = 2 years over the cap, which exposes the audit to the objectivity impairment the rotation policy prevents.",
