      "application_to_facts": "Priya's cash flow forecast drives a covenant certification, so a speculative $12 million prepayment booked at full value without disclosing the assumption and its sensitivity would mislead users about the covenant cushion.",
      "key_conclusion": "Priya preserves credibility by disclosing the prepayment as an assumption, quantifying the sensitivity, and showing the covenant position under a conservative scenario."
