    "UniqueConceptKey": "sustainability-metric-selective-disclosure-greenwashing",
    "Stem": "Priya Ramaswamy, senior analyst at Flash Foods, is reviewing the sustainability report the company prepares for investors. The report highlights that Scope 1 emissions fell 12% from the prior year but omits that total emissions, including Scope 2 and Scope 3, rose 9%, and it gives no methodology or baseline context. Which feature of the disclosure most strongly indicates greenwashing?",
