    "Stem": "Flash Manufacturing is redesigning its fraud deterrence program, and CFO Adaeze Onuorah asks controller Mariela Hoffmann how the organization's whistleblower procedures should fit within the program. Employees have raised concerns that reporting suspected fraud could put them at risk. Which statement best describes how whistleblower reporting should be integrated into the fraud deterrence program?",
