    "UniqueConceptKey": "vendor-audit-findings-escalation-path",
    "Stem": "Mariela Hoffmann, controller of Flash Manufacturing, receives an internal audit report documenting that a longtime raw-materials vendor has overbilled the company in each of the last two quarters. The vendor is a personal friend of the plant manager, who tells Mariela to keep the finding out of the monthly financial package. Under the IMA Statement of Ethical Professional Practice, what should Mariela do first?",
