    "uniqueness_note": "Conceptually distinct from A ($250,000 using 1.0 million shares), B ($500,000 using 2.0 million shares), and C ($750,000 using 3.0 million shares); only D applies the full 4.0 million share count to the $0.25 per-share gap.",
