      "application_to_facts": "Draft quarterly figures were accidentally sent outside Flash Foods before release; Priya must neither conceal nor compound the disclosure and must escalate it internally so authorized personnel can respond and assess legal duties.",
      "key_conclusion": "Priya should promptly notify her manager and the legal or compliance function so Flash Foods can contain the breach and determine its obligations."
