    "Stem": "Priya Ramaswamy, investor relations analyst at Flash Logistics, is preparing an earnings press release that will present adjusted EBITDA as the company's headline performance measure. Flash Logistics is a public company subject to SEC reporting rules. Under SEC Regulation G, what must Priya ensure accompanies the disclosure of adjusted EBITDA?",
