    "UniqueConceptKey": "cost-allocation-bonus-target-pressure",
    "Stem": "Adaeze Onuorah, chief financial officer of Flash Industrial, instructs Priya Ramaswamy, the segment analyst, to shift a larger share of shared corporate overhead away from the consumer segment so that the segment meets its earnings target and the management bonus vests. Adaeze notes that the choice of an allocation base is inherently judgmental and that she has final authority over allocation policy. Which action by Priya best preserves her professional ethics?",
