    "UniqueConceptKey": "cross-border-facilitation-payment-refusal",
    "Stem": "Naomi Castellanos, project manager for Flash Industrial's new overseas plant, is told by the local agent that customs officials routinely require a processing fee before construction equipment is released, that every company pays it, and that the payment is customary and legal under local law. Naomi asks whether paying the fee through the agent is acceptable. What is the best analysis of her situation?",
