    "ExplanationWrongA": "Local custom and the FCPA's narrow facilitation-payment exception do not make the payment ethical; the IMA Statement of Ethical Professional Practice's Integrity standard applies to members in every jurisdiction, so a payment that is customary locally can still violate the member's ethical duty and the company's anti-corruption policy.",
