    "uniqueness_note": "Choice A legitimizes artificial pricing as acceptable tax planning, Choice C treats a footnote as curing the misstatement, and Choice D treats immateriality as a license to distort; only Choice B refuses the pricing outright because it lacks economic substance, and A, C, and D each permit the misstated intercompany charges.",
