    "Stem": "Adaeze Onuorah, CFO of Flash Holdings, must sign the SOX §302 certification for the quarterly report. The controller's memo on a complex software-revenue arrangement leaves a material technical judgment unresolved, and the CEO is pressing Adaeze to sign so the filing is not delayed. What must Adaeze do before signing the certification?",
