    "UniqueConceptKey": "integrity-investment-policy-compliance-escalation",
    "Stem": "Maya Caldwell, treasurer and risk officer of Flash Capital, is directed by the CEO to move idle cash into a high-yield fund whose credit rating and duration exceed the limits in the board-approved investment policy, in order to boost short-term portfolio returns. Maya has already documented that the investment violates the policy. Under the IMA Integrity standard, what must Maya do?",
