    "UniqueConceptKey": "F-358-cybersecurity-competence-gap",
    "Stem": "Adaeze Onuorah, CFO at Flash Holdings, is asked to sign off on the quarterly cyber-risk disclosure for the board, which includes a statement that the company's ransomware defenses are 'effective and tested.' Adaeze has no cybersecurity background, and the IT security team has not provided a written assessment; her predecessor signed a similar statement quarterly. Which action best reflects the IMA Competence standard?",
