    "UniqueConceptKey": "F-359-resolution-immediate-supervisor-not-involved",
    "Stem": "Mariela Hoffmann, controller at Flash Manufacturing, observes that her immediate supervisor, the plant controller, has directed the month-end close team to capitalize routine maintenance as fixed-asset additions. Mariela has flagged the issue twice in writing; the plant controller has not responded. Under the IMA resolution process, which is the correct next step?",
