      "B": "The $850 event hospitality exceeds the $500 policy cap and requires pre-approval at $300, so the combined $970 courtesy cannot proceed under policy; the FCPA also prohibits corrupt intent, and no de minimis safe harbor exists under the FCPA",
      "C": "The $120 dinner alone is within policy, so Maya may accept both if she pays for the dinner herself",
