    "ExplanationWrongA": "The FCPA has no de minimis threshold; the $1,000 figure is a commonly cited myth. The correct analysis is whether the payment is corrupt and whether it falls within a bona fide business-promotion exception. The combined $970 also breaches Flash Capital's own $500-per-event cap and $300 pre-approval requirement, so policy alone blocks it.",
