    "ExplanationWrongD": "Not all business courtesies to foreign officials are prohibited. The FCPA allows bona fide, reasonable business entertainment that is not made with corrupt intent (e.g., customary meals and modest hospitality). The issue here is that the $850 hospitality exceeds policy and appears inconsistent with a reasonable business-promotion purpose.",
