    "UniqueConceptKey": "access-management-segregation-of-duties-ethics",
    "Stem": "During a control review at Flash Manufacturing, Mariela Hoffmann, the controller, finds that the accounts payable supervisor still holds system access to both the vendor master file and payment approvals — incompatible duties — because a past reorganization never revoked the access, and the supervisor now reports to Mariela. The supervisor says the combined access speeds month-end processing, and the CFO, Adaeze Onuorah, is reluctant to change a process that works. Which response best reflects Mariela's ethical obligations and sound internal-control practice?",
