    "Part2OnlyFlag": true,
    "UniqueConceptKey": "sustainability-metric-selection-selective-disclosure",
    "Stem": "Priya Ramaswamy, senior analyst at Flash Industrial, is preparing the company's first sustainability report and proposes disclosing Scope 1, 2, and 3 emissions with a TCFD-aligned discussion. Adaeze Onuorah, the CFO, asks her to report only Scope 1 emissions and a favorable baseline-year intensity ratio, because the full data would show rising emissions. Priya believes the omitted information is material to investors assessing climate risk. Which course of action best preserves the integrity of the report?",
