      "rule_or_proposition": "The IMA Statement's Competence standard requires members to perform professional duties in accordance with relevant laws, regulations, and technical standards, and its Integrity standard requires members to refuse to subvert the organization's legitimate and ethical objectives.",
      "application_to_facts": "ASC 606 requires revenue recognition when control of goods transfers, which occurs next quarter; recording the sale now would misstate the financials, and a verbal commitment, a footnote, or CFO authorization would not change the recognition timing.",
