      "rule_or_proposition": "Under the Integrity standard, management accountants must communicate information fairly and objectively, including unfavorable as well as favorable information, and must not engage in conduct that might prejudice carrying out duties ethically.",
      "application_to_facts": "Adaeze's request to omit the declining backlog and strike an upbeat tone would make the lenders' review deceptive, so Mariela must include the unfavorable backlog information.",
