    "Stem": "CFO Adaeze Onuorah of Flash Industrial learns that a division controller capitalized routine repair costs to hit the division's profit target and was told not to inform the audit committee. When Adaeze raised the concern with the CEO, the CEO said the matter should be handled quietly and kept out of the audit committee's hands.",
