    "uniqueness_note": "Choice A (CFO endorsement), B (silent adjustment), and D (indefinite withholding) are three distinct failures: A shifts responsibility to a superior, B substitutes concealment for disclosure, and D abandons timely communication; each contradicts the Credibility standard's disclosure duty that only C satisfies.",
