      "application_to_facts": "The override records 6,000 units that were not physically counted (58,000 minus 52,000), overstating ending inventory by $54,000 at $9.00 per unit and, through the periodic inventory equation, understating cost of goods sold and overstating pre-tax income by the same amount.",
