    "UniqueConceptKey": "resolution-of-conflict-supervisor-escalation-documentation",
    "Stem": "Mariela Hoffmann, controller of Flash Manufacturing, discovers that the vice president of finance, Adaeze Onuorah, has directed her to alter production cost records before quarter-end so that reported margins meet the board's target. Company policy directs employees with ethics concerns to their immediate supervisor, and Mariela's immediate supervisor is Adaeze. Adaeze dismisses Mariela's objection and insists on the alteration. Per the IMA Statement of Ethical Professional Practice's resolution-of-conflict process, what is Mariela's next required action?",
