    "UniqueConceptKey": "fraud-detection-internal-whistleblower-reporting",
    "Stem": "Lena Fischer, a financial analyst at Flash Capital, notices that revenue from one large client is recognized in the same quarter the contract is signed, before any goods ship or services are performed, and the pattern repeats in subsequent quarters. Lena suspects the CFO, Adaeze Onuorah, is directing premature revenue recognition. Which analysis of Lena's fraud-detection and whistleblower responsibilities under the Sarbanes-Oxley Act is most accurate?",
