    "ExplanationWrongC": "An external auditor's opinion does not substitute for the certifying officer's personal evaluation and disclosure of controls and significant deficiencies; Section 302 duties are the officer's own, and Section 906 adds criminal penalties for false certification.",
    "ExplanationWrongD": "Good-faith reliance on subsidiary management's representations does not satisfy Section 302, which requires the officer to evaluate the effectiveness of disclosure controls and disclose known deficiencies across the consolidated group.",
