    "UniqueConceptKey": "integrity-current-period-impairment-recognition",
    "Stem": "During a restructuring at Flash Industrial, the CFO, Adaeze Onuorah, asks the senior analyst, Priya Ramaswamy, to delay recognizing an impairment of a production facility until the next quarter so that the current quarter's results meet the debt-covenant threshold. The facility is clearly impaired and the loss is measurable under ASC 360-10. What action best preserves Priya's integrity and the reliability of the financial statements?",
