    "question_state": "Certified",
    "Part2OnlyFlag": true,
    "UniqueConceptKey": "credibility-balanced-narrative-nongaap-disclosure",
    "Stem": "Priya Ramaswamy, the investor relations analyst at Flash Logistics, is drafting the quarterly earnings narrative. The CFO, Adaeze Onuorah, wants the release to lead with adjusted (non-GAAP) earnings and to omit the drop in operating cash flow and the loss of a major customer because those items are not part of the adjusted story. Which approach best satisfies the IMA Credibility standard and SEC Regulation G?",
