    "Stem": "At Flash Foods, analyst Priya Ramaswamy is asked to finalize a $2,000,000 supplier cost allocation before completing the competence training her role requires. On this judgment-heavy task, historically 25% of analyses by untrained staff contain errors, versus 5% for fully trained analysts. What is the expected dollar exposure from relying on Priya's undeveloped professional judgment?",
