    "UniqueConceptKey": "performance-review-fairness-honest-disclosure-credit",
    "Stem": "Controller Mariela Hoffmann at Flash Manufacturing is rating a segment manager who voluntarily disclosed an inventory misstatement that reduced reported segment profit. CFO Adaeze Onuorah suggests the profit decline should lower the manager's rating because results are what matter. Which evaluation approach is most consistent with the ethics of fair performance review?",
