    "Stem": "Mariela Hoffmann, controller of Flash Holdings, learns that a new regulation in a foreign subsidiary conflicts with a requirement in the company's internal control policy. She confirms that the conflict implicates both the Integrity and Credibility standards of the IMA Statement of Ethical Professional Practice, and that no department has yet addressed it. According to the IMA Statement, what should Mariela do first to resolve this ethical conflict?",
