      "rule_or_proposition": "Credibility requires members to communicate information fairly and objectively and to disclose all relevant information that could reasonably be expected to influence an intended user's understanding of the reports.",
      "application_to_facts": "Lena must present the corrected injury count: 32 - 3 = 29 injuries over 1,000,000 hours worked, giving 29 / (1,000,000 / 200,000) = 29 / 5 = 5.8 per 200,000 hours.",
      "key_conclusion": "The corrected injury rate is 5.8 per 200,000 hours worked."
