    "UniqueConceptKey": "fraud-deterrence-ethics-program-culture-integration",
    "Stem": "Flash Manufacturing's audit committee has asked controller Mariela Hoffmann to report on whether the company's anti-fraud controls are actually reducing fraud risk rather than just existing on paper. In her review, Mariela observes that the ethics hotline is rarely used, employees cannot explain the code of conduct, and fraud training is a once-a-year check-the-box session. Under the IMA Statement of Ethical Professional Practice, which integration of the ethics program into the corporate culture best strengthens fraud deterrence at Flash Manufacturing?",
