      "rule_or_proposition": "The Credibility standard requires members to communicate information fairly and objectively and to disclose all relevant information that could reasonably be expected to influence an intended user's understanding of reports and analyses.",
      "application_to_facts": "Adopting a TCFD-aligned framework while omitting the 150,000-ton Scope 3 estimate would understate climate-related financial exposure by $7,500,000 at a $50 carbon price, so the incremental exposure must be quantified for the disclosure to be fair and objective.",
