    "Stem": "Naomi Castellanos, project manager at Flash Logistics, is leading the rollout of a new AI-based demand-forecasting module whose vendor training was brief. She is unsure whether the module's assumptions fit the company's freight-demand patterns. Under the Competence standard of the IMA Statement of Ethical Professional Practice, what must Naomi do before relying on the module's outputs for the operating budget?",
