    "UniqueConceptKey": "objectivity-internal-audit-reporting-line",
    "Stem": "Maya Caldwell, treasurer and risk officer at Flash Industrial, is reviewing the internal audit charter. The chief audit executive currently reports administratively and functionally to Adaeze Onuorah, the CFO, who also approves the annual audit plan and hires the CAE. Under the IMA Statement of Ethical Professional Practice, which change best preserves the internal audit function's objectivity?",
