    "Stem": "Flash Capital issued a $200 million green bond whose prospectus commits the proceeds to qualifying renewable-energy projects. Lena Fischer, the financial analyst preparing the use-of-proceeds report, learns that treasurer Maya Caldwell directed part of the proceeds into a general operating account to cover a temporary cash shortfall, to be repaid before the first report is due. Under the IMA Statement of Ethical Professional Practice, what must Lena recognize in preparing the report that follows the Green Bond Principles?",
