    "UniqueConceptKey": "whistleblower-report-identity-need-to-know",
    "Stem": "Lena Fischer, a financial analyst at Flash Logistics, used the company's confidential whistleblower hotline to report that a segment manager deferred legitimate expenses to inflate quarterly operating income. As controller Mariela Hoffmann opens the investigation, the general counsel proposes sharing Lena's name with the accused manager so he can respond fairly, and the audit committee chair asks whether protection depends on the report being substantiated. Which of the following best describes how Flash Logistics should handle the whistleblower program's confidentiality and protection obligations?",
