    "Stem": "Adaeze Onuorah, CFO of Flash Manufacturing, directs controller Mariela Hoffmann to recognize revenue on units shipped to a customer's warehouse the day before the customer's acceptance testing, arguing that the risk of return is remote and the quarter ends tomorrow. Mariela believes control of the goods has not yet transferred and that the entry would overstate revenue. Which of the following best describes how Mariela should respond under the IMA standards?",
