    "ExplanationWrongC": "",
    "ExplanationWrongD": "Choice D understates timely disclosure by conditioning it on winning; the error delays reporting until after the $2.4 million award, which violates the requirement to disclose and mitigate conflicts before influence occurs, not after results are known.",
