    "ExplanationWrongA": "",
    "ExplanationWrongB": "Choice B misstates violation by describing compliant behavior; the misconception labels full balanced disclosure of the $600,000 contingency as a breach, while Credibility actually requires completeness and objectivity, which B satisfies.",
