    "Topic": "F.430 ethical-issue-identification-whistleblower-mechanisms",
    "Stem": "Flash Dynamics analyst Priya Desai, Internal auditor, learns that Flash's plant manager instructed staff to override a quality control hold to meet a shipment deadline. Flash policy requires documentation of holds and has a confidential hotline. Flash's quarterly revenue target is $12 million and the shipment at risk is $400,000. What is the most appropriate ethical identification and response?",
