    "Topic": "F.439 fraud-triangle-opportunity-and-control-weakness",
    "Stem": "Flash Components analyst Marco Bellini, Controller, is mapping fraud risks for Flash's payables cycle after an $85,000 duplicate-payment scheme was found. The scheme succeeded because the same clerk could create vendors and approve payments up to $50,000 without segregation, and reconciliations were 45 days late. Which correctly identifies the opportunity element and remediation under the Fraud Triangle?",
