    "Stem": "Flash Electronics analyst Henrik Larsen, Treasurer, is investigating a $240,000 lapping scheme in accounts receivable where a cashier stole $60,000 customer payment and covered it with a subsequent customer's $60,000 payment, repeating for four cycles. Flash has $4.8 million receivables and $12 million revenue. Which description correctly identifies lapping and a detective control for Flash?",
