    "Stem": "Flash Global analyst Adaeze Onuorah, CFO, and the CEO are preparing SOX 302 certifications for Flash's quarterly filing. Flash has $620 million assets, $45 million net income, and disclosed a $1.2 million control deficiency in payables. The CEO suggests the CFO certify alone to save time. Which correctly applies SOX 302 certification duty for Flash?",
